{"overview":{"Symbol":"ETOR","Name":"eToro Group Ltd.","Description":"eToro Group Ltd. engages in the trading business. Its multi-asset platform supports trading and investing in equities, crypto assets, commodities, currencies, and options, which can be traded either as assets or as derivatives related to various underlying asset types. The company also operates eToro Club, a membership program providing a range of services and tools to enhance a user's investment experience; eToro Academy, an education hub to improve users' understanding of financial markets; and eToro Money, a money management solution that enables users to make deposits and withdrawals, as well as to trade local stocks in local currencies. In addition, it provides various investment tools and services, including charting and analysis tools and extended-hours trading. Further, the company offers CopyTrader, Pro Investor, and Smart Portfolios program to follow and replicate the trading activities of other users or portfolios. eToro Group Ltd. was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Bnei Brak, Israel.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"Israel","Sector":"Financial Services","Industry":"Capital Markets","Address":"30 Sheshet Hayamim Street, Bnei Brak, 5120261, Israel","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"3041911040","EBITDA":"","PERatio":"15.937499","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"16.365","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"2.4","RevenuePerShareTTM":"144.563","ProfitMargin":"0.01924","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.0276","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.15292","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.20965","RevenueTTM":"12376691712","GrossProfitTTM":"405070016","DilutedEPSTTM":"2.4","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"0.375","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"-0.356","AnalystTargetPrice":"55.86667","TrailingPE":"15.937499","ForwardPE":"11.775789","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"0.2457774","PriceToBookRatio":"2.3373053","EVToRevenue":"0.175","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"68.66","5